//! Creature species of Crimson Desert build 26361232, by how they are caught.
//!
//! Generated by crates/tools/src/bin/gen-species.rs (`just gen-species`) from
//! the game's own archive tables: characterinfo, interactioninfo,
//! tribeinfo and charactergroupinfo (with knowledgeinfo, iteminfo, npcinfo,
//! mercenaryinfo, vehicleinfo, regioninfo and jobinfo for the per-record
//! layout check). Do not edit by hand; rerun `just gen-species`.
//!
//! The rule. A bag catch is a characterinfo record whose interaction list
//! holds `Insect_Catch` and whose `convertItemInfo` is not 0; it is a `Bug`,
//! `Fish` or `Critter` by the level-2 group of its tribe chain (the insect
//! group, the fish group, any other group). Every other record whose name
//! starts with `Animal_` (any case) is `NotHandCatchable`. Every record
//! not named `Animal_*` whose interaction list holds `Dead_Loot` is a body,
//! classed by its spawn ally group (`CharacterGroup_Ally_*`): `Protected`
//! for `Ally_Player` or a playable `nonePlayerSubType` (3), `FriendlyBody`
//! for `Ally_NPC`, `Ally_Guard` and `Ally_Mercenary`, `Body` for
//! `Ally_Enemy` and `Ally_Aniaml_Wild`, and in no ally group by its
//! `isEnableFriendly` flag (1 `FriendlyBody`, 0 `Body`). Any other name is
//! absent.

/// How a creature species is caught.
#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]
pub enum SpeciesClass {
    /// A bag catch in the insect tribe group.
    Bug,
    /// A bag catch in the fish tribe group.
    Fish,
    /// A bag catch in any other tribe group (small animals, birds, ...).
    Critter,
    /// An `Animal_*` record that is not a bag catch: carried, skinned,
    /// ridden, or not caught at all.
    NotHandCatchable,
    /// A hostile person or monster (not `Animal_*`; `Ally_Enemy`, or no
    /// ally group and `isEnableFriendly` 0: bandits, criminals, monsters)
    /// whose corpse is searched (`Dead_Loot`): never a catch.
    Body,
    /// A person who was not an enemy (`Ally_NPC`, `Ally_Guard`,
    /// `Ally_Mercenary`, or no ally group and `isEnableFriendly` 1:
    /// citizens, traders, named uniques, mercenaries) whose corpse is
    /// searched: never a catch.
    FriendlyBody,
    /// The player's own characters and their doubles (`Ally_Player`, or
    /// `nonePlayerSubType` 3): never searched, caught or skinned.
    Protected,
}

